# [WIMSE](../wg/wimse.html)

## Summary

The Workload Identity in a Multi-System Environment (WIMSE) working group met to review active working group documents, receive updates from the hackathon, discuss emerging individual contributions, and plan upcoming working group milestones. Key milestones discussed included initiating a Working Group Last Call for `draft-ietf-wimse-arch` and planning a formal Call for Adoption for the Workload Authorization Grant (WAG) specification.

